msgstr ""
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"

msgid "CUPS Helper - optimization"
msgstr "CUPS 助手 - 优化"

msgid "These values are written into a managed block inside /etc/cups/cupsd.conf and applied by restarting cupsd. Queues are published over mDNS so clients find the printer without typing an address."
msgstr "这些值会写入 /etc/cups/cupsd.conf 的受管块并重启 cupsd 生效。队列通过 mDNS 发布，客户端不用手填地址就能发现打印机。"

msgid "Settings"
msgstr "设置"

msgid "Publish queues over mDNS (avahi)"
msgstr "通过 mDNS 发布队列（avahi）"

msgid "Requires avahi-daemon. Then phones and desktops list the queue automatically."
msgstr "需要 avahi-daemon。装好后手机和电脑会自动列出这个队列。"

msgid "Listen on all interfaces"
msgstr "在所有接口上监听"

msgid "Off = localhost only (printers unreachable from the LAN)."
msgstr "关闭 = 只监听本机（局域网访问不到打印机）。"

msgid "CUPS log level"
msgstr "CUPS 日志级别"

msgid "error keeps the flash writes down on a small device."
msgstr "小设备上用 error 可以减少写 flash。"

msgid "error"
msgstr "error"

msgid "warn"
msgstr "warn"

msgid "info"
msgstr "info"

msgid "debug"
msgstr "debug"

msgid "Max queued jobs"
msgstr "队列中最大任务数"

msgid "Default 50."
msgstr "默认 50。"

msgid "Max jobs per printer"
msgstr "每台打印机最大任务数"

msgid "Default 10."
msgstr "默认 10。"

msgid "Keep job history (days, 0 = never)"
msgstr "保留任务历史（天，0 = 不保留）"

msgid "On tmpfs every reboot clears it anyway; 1 is enough for troubleshooting."
msgstr "/var 是 tmpfs，重启本来就会清空；1 天足够排查问题。"

msgid "Allowed subnets"
msgstr "允许访问的网段"

msgid "Comma separated CIDRs, e.g. 192.168.1.0/24, 10.80.1.0/24. Every Allow list in cupsd.conf is rewritten to 127.0.0.1 plus these subnets. Leave empty to keep the CUPS defaults (10/8, 172.16/12, 192.168/16)."
msgstr "多个 CIDR 用逗号分隔，例如 192.168.1.0/24, 10.80.1.0/24。cupsd.conf 里所有 Allow 列表会被改成 127.0.0.1 + 这些网段；留空则保持 CUPS 默认（10/8、172.16/12、192.168/16）。"

msgid "Invalid CIDR: "
msgstr "网段格式不正确："

